==Russian==

===Etymology===
Unclear. Thought to be related to {{m|ru|тасова́ть|t=to shuffle (cards)}}, which is from {{m+|w=1|fr|tasser|t=to pile together}}, from {{m|fr|tas|t=pile, heap}}. Alternatively, thought to derive from {{m+|w=1|fr|tous|t=everyone}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|тусо́вка}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Rominf-тусовка.wav}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|тусо́вка|*|adj=тусо́вочный|clip=ту́са|expr=тусня́,тусня́к}}

# informal [[party]] for young people, [[get-together]], "tusovka"
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} a group of people with a common interest, such as musicians, artists

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|тусо́вка|*}}

